  "$palette": "Palette mirrors the Figma colour styles (group/family/step, group dropped from token names). '$status': provisional = value not yet confirmed by a Figma export; awaiting-figma = no value yet (null). Primary families place Base in the 400 slot, Secondary and States in the 500 slot, as in Figma. product = value taken from what the Tabs platform ships today (use-tabs/tabs theme.ts and component classes)."
